SUMMARY:Explore the Museum of Costume Jewelry
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome check out Asheville's newest museum
 \, the Museum of Costume Jewelry! According to their website\, "The Museum
  of Costume Jewelry is dedicated to the collection\, preservation\, resear
 ch\, and exhibition of 20th century costume jewelry." We'll wander the mus
 eum together\, and for those who are interested we may walk to a cafe afte
 rward to discuss some of our favorite pieces. For more information about t
 he museum\, please visit their website: [https://museumofcostumejewelry.co
 m/](https://museumofcostumejewelry.com/)\n\n**Admission**\nWhile no admiss
 ion fee is listed on their website\, the museum is a 501(c)3 nonprofit org
 anization and accepts donations. They also have a gift shop\, so bring you
 r wallet if you are a fan of shiny things!\n\n**Parking**\nStreet parking 
 is extremely limited by the museum\, so I would recommend parking in garag
 e instead. The Rankin Avenue garage is just around the block from the muse
 um located at 68 Rankin Avenue.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/315545038
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T145734Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T145734Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
