SUMMARY:Asheville Science Museum 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nInside all of us there are two dragons. 
 One dragon craves knowledge and the other\, delicious food. Satiate both w
 ith a trip to the Asheville museum of science and then an (optional) lunch
  at Foggy Mountain Brew Pub.\n\nThere are two parking garages across the s
 treet from the museum (downtown)\, and we can walk to the restaurant from 
 the museum.\n\nThe plan is to meet at the museum at 10:20. Museum admissio
 n is $11.50 available [Here.](https://checkout.square.site/merchant/6GSW8M
 9SARDXA/checkout/L2TWNZX2MUHFQQZDMBETE64A)\n\nUpdate: I have checked the A
 sheville library about zoom pass information and unfortunately you cannot 
 get a zoom pass for weekends.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/315545682
 /
